                "caption": "Figure 1:GroundAnything architecture.Clean multimodal inputs and response-corrupted text views share one visual encoding and jointly supervise causal prediction and masked denoising. One noisy view is illustrated, with its uncorrupted prompt copy omitted for clarity. The bottom-left panel illustrates parallel denoising, and the grounding example includes two minions and one human and an absent car category. Architecture specifications and parameter counts are provided inSection6.2.",
